2026-08-10 13:37:29,644 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   The Škoda Kodiaq is a spacious vehicle designed with three rows of seating to accommodate up to seven passengers. It features a bold exterior design with a longer profile, a unique dark chrome finish on the D-pillar, a wider front grille with a horizontal light strip, and C-shaped LED rear lights connected by a full-width decorative strip. The vehicle is equipped with LED headlights featuring a coloured crystalline element, or advanced LED Matrix Beam Headlights that automatically adjust to avoid blinding oncoming traffic.
2026-08-10 13:37:29,644 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-10 13:37:29,644 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   Inside, the Kodiaq offers a digital environment featuring a standard 26.03 cm Virtual Cockpit and a 32.77 cm touchscreen infotainment system, which comes with a dedicated display cleaner stored in the centre console. The cabin utilizes eco-friendly leather and recycled materials, enhanced by customizable ambient lighting on the dashboard and doors. For comfort, the vehicle is equipped with Ergo front seats that support back health and offer heating, cooling, and pneumatic massage functions.
2026-08-10 13:37:29,644 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-10 13:37:29,645 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   Convenience features include Škoda Smart Dials that combine manual and touchscreen controls, a gear selector mounted on the steering column to free up centre console space, and a ventilated wireless charging pad that can charge two smartphones simultaneously at up to 15W. It also features KESSY Advanced for automatic locking and unlocking on approach or walk-away, a two-piece panoramic sunroof with an electric sunshade, and a Virtual Pedal that opens the tailgate with a swing of a foot.
2026-08-10 13:37:29,647 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-10 13:37:29,647 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   For safety and driver assistance, the Kodiaq includes Front Assist with warning and braking, Side Assist for blind-spot monitoring, an Exit Warning System to prevent door-opening collisions, and Intelligent Park Assist to help steer the car into parking spaces. The Kodiaq RS variant specifically offers additional features such as a 725W CANTON sound system with 13 speakers and a subwoofer, a 360-degree area view camera, and 40:20:40 split-folding second-row backrests with a remote folding pull handle in the boot.
