2026-08-10 14:12:31,299 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\KodiaqRS.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': '## Škoda Kodiaq RS SURRENDER\n\nKodiaq RS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nKodiaq RS\n\nRS\n\n8\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Surrender to performance\n\nThe most spacious Škoda with a dose of dynamic DNA. Powered by the 2.0 TSl/195 kW 4×4 engine and fitted with sporty DCC suspension, it offers a spirited driving experience.\n\n## Surrender to sporty looks\n\nTo match its dynamic personality, the Kodiaq RS comes with striking, sporty looks. You\'ll immediately notice the gloss black details like the grille, window trim, mirror caps, roof rails, and D-pillar. The larger, aerodynamic front bumper with front intakes and rear bumper with black diffuser and twin exhaust underscore the sporty nature of the car. The final touch comes in the form of the 20" black wheels with bright red brake calipers prominently visible behind them. So the car looks fast, even standing still!\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Surrender to the feeling\n\nSpacious or sporty? With the new Kodiaq RS, you don\'t have to choose! Your family can enjoy the roomy and practical interior while you focus on driving. The three-spoke multifunctional sports steering wheel is perfect for hitting that ideal line through a corner. The leather sports seats keep you firmly in place and offer exceptional comfort on long-distance drives. Red stitching throughout the interior completes the sporty look. Enjoy the dynamic soundtrack of your choice with the Canton Sound System and acoustic window glass. The Virtual Pedal and KESSY Advanced provide quick and easy access to your car. Whether you\'re on the city commute or navigating your favourite back road, you can feel sporty and appreciate the car\'s stylish appearance, even at low speeds.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Surrender to the details\n\nFor a sporty yet luxurious look and feel, the RS interior uses only the best materials. Black perforated leather with contrasting red stitching on the seats, steering wheel, and dashboard pad tastefully matches the chrome decor.\n\n## Surrender to the colours\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMoon White', '_id': '3edf6497-ba88-4cd5-a2fa-c586d55a0864', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
