2026-08-10 14:31:00,896 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\Kylaq.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "## SKODA Kylaq\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nYears Standard Warranty* Free Services** Years Roadside Assistance\n\nThe Škoda Super Care programme is applicable to all new Škoda vehicles purchased on or after 1st January 2026.* Each Škoda vehicle is covered by warranty for a period of 4 years or 100,000 km, whichever occurs earlier. **The 4 free services scheduled at 1,000 km, 7,500 km, 15,000 km and 30,000 km are limited to free labour charges only. Roadside Assistance is subject to Škoda Assist's standard coverage areas and service terms. #Sub-4 metre ICE vehicles, as per the BNCAP rating.\n\n- Introduction\n- Exterior Design 一\n- Interior Design 1\n- Comfort &amp; Safety\n- Simply Clever Features\n- Wheels &amp; Upholstery 1\n- Colours 1\n- Variants 1\n- Technical Specifications 1\n\n## European Engineering, Crafted with Comfort in Mind.\n\nIntroducing the Škoda Kylaq. A modern-solid design built to conquer Indian roads with confidence. Sleek yet powerful, it combines performance, efficiency, and safety for every journey. This is more than a car, it's the Indian dream, built to drive.\n\nKylaq\n\n## Exterior Design\n\nThe Škoda Kylaq's exterior is a study in modern elegance. With its bold lines and purposeful design, it commands attention while staying true to the practicality and durability you need for every road ahead.\n\nMH14TCM310\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSEOTS\n\n## Interior Design\n\nStep inside the Škoda Kylaq, and you're greeted by an environment that's as refined as it is welcoming. With an ambiance tailored for comfort, it's a space you'll love to call your own.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Comfort Safety", '_id': '54b1fc19-3230-46b5-a157-1efe56b069b9', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
