Slavia has 2 engine variants (1.0 TSI and 1.5 TSI) with 2 gearbox variants each. All variants have SSR and deliver efficiency with dynamism.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Manual Transmission", '_id': '2fdbfae1-ffcf-48bf-8f60-0583ac7fc6b9', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
