| Classic+         | 8 25 000  | 9 25 000  |\n| Signature        | 9 43 000  | 10 43 000 |\n| Signature+       | 10 77 000 | 11 77 000 |\n| Prestige         | 11 75 000 | 12 75 000 |\n| Prestige+        | 11 99 000 | 12 99 000 |\n\nEx-Showroom price\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nCherry Red", '_id': 'c4f49e40-bec6-41e0-9778-b04fee8c1e34', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
