2026-08-10 14:31:00,953 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\Kodiaq.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "<!-- image -->\n\n## Two phones wireless charging\n\nA first for Škoda: the new Kodiaq offers wireless charging for two smartphones with ventilation to prevent your devices from overheating and charging power up to 15 W per phone.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Space for seven\n\nEven more space for your family or friends. The new larger interior offers comfortable seating in three rows with more room than ever before.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Intelligent Park Assist\n\nLet your car find and offer you parking spaces. Select oea  hcd e  is s   dab wil autonousl rve atsefito he parkiang sace, wihd o  eg ht e hie h t odls\n\n## Enhanced Safety with Advanced Driver Assistance Systems\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Front Assist with Warning &amp; Braking\n\nIt senses what you might miss. When a vehicle slows, a pedestrian steps in, or a cyclist cuts across, the system warns you instantly. And if a collision becomes unavoidable, it steps in and brakes. Because sometimes, every millisecond matters.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## LED Matrix Beam Headlights\n\nSee everything. Blind no one. Using a multi-function camera, the system detects oncoming traffic and automatically adjusts the beam, maintaining maximum visibility for you, while shielding others from glare. Precision lighting, for confident night driving.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Side Assist\n\nEyes where yours can't be. Detects vehicles approaching from behind or sitting in your blind spot and alerts you before you make your move. So every lane-change feels considered, not chanced.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Exit Warning System\n\nSafety doesn't stop when the engine does. This system alerts you and your passengers if opening a door could lead to an incoming collision from a passing vehicle, cyclist, or pedestrian. So danger doesn't wait for you to step out.\n\n## Sportline orem\n\nKodiaq Sportline\n\n## Backin black", '_id': '98e65683-454b-46d5-a27c-2b25fd1d6773', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
