2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Motor Slip Regulation
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Ms e s e  et e ds e usee  o sue ing sudden speed reductions, thus preventing wheel slip. Standard across all variants.
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Park Distance Control
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Park in small spaces with ease. This system is standard across all variants and helps you factor in nearby objects to help you park safely.
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Anti-theft Alarm
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  This function, which is standard across all variants, detects vibrations to identify invalid access to the vehicle and immediately sends you an SMS in case of an attempted breach.
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Traction Control System
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  TCS/ASR, which is standard across all variants, helps stabilize the vehicle when driving on low-grip roads. It reduces the drive power transmitted to the wheels when they spin.
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Brake Disc Wiping
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  The BDW feature enhances safety while driving in the rain by removing excess water from the brake to maintain a short braking distance. This feature is standard across all variants.
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  <!-- image -->
2026-08-10 14:31:00,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
