2026-08-10 14:32:27,960 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\Kushaq.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "## The new Škoda Kushaq Easy to O\n\nKushaq\n\n4 SKODA Years Standard Warranty* Labour-free Services** Super Care Years Roadside Assistance\n\nSKODA\n\nKushaq\n\nSome things are easy to love from the start. Others make you work for it. Cars often fall into the second category, where the best features are saved for later, or higher up. The new Škoda Kushaq does the opposite. With thoughtful design, solid build, and the essentials you actually want, built in from the beginning, every drive feels complete, considered, and reassuring. Making the new Škoda Kushaq - Easy to love.\n\n## Kushaq The neW\n\n## Easy toflaunt\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nKushaq\n\nFront grille illuminated light band with LED headlights LED taillights, Illuminated 'Škoda' lettering and sequential turn indicators SKODA\n\nKushaq\n\nKUSHAQ\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nR17 Alloy wheels with sporty red brake calipers\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Easy to drive ■\n\n7\n\n551pm\n\n220 m First-in-segment\n\n8-speed torque converter automatic transmission paired with 1.0 TSl engine\n\n7-speed DSG paired with 1.5 TSI engine\n\n6-speed manual transmission paired with 1.0 TSl engine\n\n88j\n\n220\n\nAVC\n\nAir Care\n\n8\n\nR\n\nN\n\nS/O\n\nAIC\n\nA\n\nAUTO\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nFirst-in-segment\n\nRear seat massager\n\n## Panoramic sunroof\n\nBest-in-segment\n\nSunroofs are now standard across all variants*\n\n*Panoramic sunroof available only in Prestige and Monte Carlo\n\n130\n\n06\n\n50\n\n20\n\n30\n\n40\n\n636m pm 2:06 AN\n\n50\n\nTurn left\n\n220 m\n\n151 km\n\ntrip 257.8 km\n\n100\n\nN\n\nkm/h\n\n40\n\n5:53 pm\n\n7517 km\n\n26.03 cm Virtual Cockpit with turn-by-turn navigation\n\n80\n\n140\n\n180\n\n220\n\n092\n\n1/2\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Easy to trust\n\nK\n\nKushaq\n\nKUSHAQ\n\nGLOBAL\n\nKushaq LED fog lamps and Park Pilot\n\n## Easy to own\n\n## Easy to drive. Now easier to live with.\n\nBuilt for the love of the drive. With Škoda Super Care, certified service teams, genuine parts, and support across 180+ cities, with the new Škoda Kushaq, you never drive alone.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nKushaq", '_id': '8e5263d9-2e83-4f3f-876a-32f2f65c9faf', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
