2026-08-10 14:47:19,353 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\Kylaq.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': '<!-- image -->\n\nLava Blue\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nCarbon Steel\n\nDeep Black\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nBrilliant Silver\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Kylaq Classic\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Classic Features Overview\n\n- Škoda Crystalline LED Headlamps\n- LED Daytime Running Lights \\_\n- Škoda Crystalline LED Tail lamps \\_\n- Standard 6 Airbags (front / side / curtain)\n- \\_ 25+ Safety features\n- ABS /EBD/ESC/TCS \\_\n- Brake Disc Wiping \\_\n- Parking Sensor at rear\n- R16 Steel wheel without cover \\_\n- Manual AC \\_\n- Driver seat manual height adjustable\n- Adjustable headrests for all seats \\_\n- Roof Rails \\_\n- Front+Rear Door armrest with cushioned upholstery\n- \\_ Electrically adjustable exterior mirror\n- Tilt &amp; Telescopic steering wheel \\_\n- 12V power socket in front \\_\n- \\_ Radio fitment preparation And many more...\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Classic+ Features Overview (In addition to Classic Features)\n\n- Electric Sunroof with anti-pinch technology \\_\n- R16 Steel wheel with full cover\n- \\_ Rear LED Reading Lamp\n- Cruise Control \\_\n- Multifunctional Steering Wheel \\_\n- Front &amp; Rear Speakers (4 nos.) \\_\n- \\_ Auto dimming interior rear-view mirror\n- Automatic front wiper system with rain sensor \\_ And many more...\n\n## Kylaq Signature\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Signature Features Overview (In addition to Classic+ Features)\n\n- \\_ Tyre Pressure Monitoring System\n- R16 Silver Alloy Wheel \\_\n- 17.7cm Škoda Touch Infotainment System \\_\n- \\_ Wired Android Auto &amp; Apple Carplay via USB\n- \\_ 2x USB-C Type socket in rear\n- Front central armrest with storage box and sliding function\n- Glove box cooling \\_\n- \\_ Rear wiper and washer\n- Rear Defogger \\_\n- Metallic décor elements \\_\n- \\_ Interior door lock handle in chrome\n- Adjustable rear AC vents\n- Stowing space for parcel tray\n- \\_ Smartphone Pocket\n- \\_ Paddle Shifter (AT Only) And many more...\n\n## Kylaq Signature+\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Signature+ Features Overview (In addition to Signature Features)', '_id': '91fb39c3-fd55-4b4b-8dd3-a40a0c5dc302', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
