2026-08-10 14:58:54,805 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:58:54,806 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Full hands are not a problem anymore. With Virtual Pedal, just a swing of the foot under the bumper is enough to open the door.
