2026-08-10 14:58:54,807 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## KESSY Advanced
2026-08-10 14:58:54,807 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 14:58:54,808 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Never forget to lock your car again. KESSY is not only able to lock and unlock the car just by you touching the front handle in its latest iteration, it also uses the 'Open on Approach and Walk Away Locking functions', where the car automatically unlocks when approached and locks again when you walk away from it.
